Z||000000||Formula88||08-28-2001||10:35 AM||||The following was forwarded to me from a friend on <A HREF="http://www.grandprix.net:" TARGET=_blank>www.grandprix.net:</A> <P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><I>Taken from http:\\www.grandprix.net </I><BR>On Saturday, September 8, the Tarheel Tigers Pontiac Club will be hosting an all Pontiac car show at Crown Pontiac in Raleigh, NC.  Registration is from 9:00 until noon.  The Performance Pontiacs of the Carolinas will be meeting at the Bob Evans on I-40 in Burlington at 8:00 to eat breakfast and convoy out to the show.  If anyone would like to join us, feel free.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Sounds like a great opportunity for any central NC Fiero owners to show up and give some Fiero representation! <P>------------------<BR>"God made us brothers.  Prozac made us friends."<p>[This message has been edited by Formula88 (edited 08-28-2001).]||||reg||10
